    <string name="sample_title">Welcome to ClipperCast</string>
    <string name="sample_body">Welcome to ClipperCast. This is a sample article so you can try the reader and the voice right away, even without an internet connection.\n\nSaving articles is simple. While reading a page in Chrome, tap the three-dot menu, choose Share, then choose ClipperCast. The link is saved instantly, and the content is downloaded and cleaned up in the background.\n\nSaved articles live on your phone. You can read them with five color themes and many fonts and text sizes. Tap the middle of the screen to show the toolbar.\n\nWhen your hands are busy, tap the headphones button to listen to the article like a podcast episode. The sentence being read is highlighted. You can change the speed, set a sleep timer, and queue up several articles to listen to in a row.\n\nClipperCast needs no account and never sends your data anywhere. Happy reading!</string>
